# Line endings are part of the product here: the PowerShell bridge is verified against a
# SHA-256 manifest, so a CRLF checkout on Windows changed the hash and the provider was
# refused with "hash_mismatch" (reported 2026-11-15). The runtime normalises CRLF as well;
# this file keeps new clones byte-identical to the manifest in the first place.
*.ps1           text eol=lf
*.properties    text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.java          text eol=lf
*.md            text eol=lf
*.gradle        text eol=lf
gradlew         text eol=lf
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.png           binary
*.jar           binary
